  "description": "Proposed extension to the existing Eruv in Mill Hill comprising of works at the following 4no. sites along The Ridgeway (Locations 4, 5, 6 and 7).\r- Location 4, Belmont Farm access gates - Installation of polycarbonate sheet to each gate post; Installation of timber post and rail fence and new arch\r- Location 5, Sheepwash Pond - Replacement of existing timber post and tubular rail fence to pond.\r- Location 6, Between Sheepwash Pond and St Paul's Church Hall - Installation of a 2.3m high rustic arch and 1.05m high post and rail fence \r- Location 7, Footpath between St Paul's C of E Primary School and The Bungalow - Installation of a 2.3m high timber rustic arch and 1.05m high post and rail fence\r- Removal of existing poles  at the following locations - 1no adjacent to Belmont Farm; 1no. north of war memorial; 1no. to the right hand side of Mill Hill School vehicular access",
